.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-checks 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-checks \- Whether a commit\*(Aqs check runs answer the question a landing depends on
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten checks\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Whether a commit\*(Aqs check runs answer the question a landing depends on
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-checks\-green(1)
Refuse a head whose required checks are red, still running, or not yet registered
.TP
batten\-checks\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
